; The one variable is the emission shape of a GPUParticles3D: a sphere, a sphere surface, a box and
; a ring, side by side. `use_fixed_seed` makes the pose the same on each run, and `preprocess` runs
; the simulation forward so the particles have left their shape. Each dot is unshaded, so no
; lit-sphere silhouette adds to the difference with Godot. No other golden shows a regression in
; the emission shape of a GPUParticles3D: the emission gizmo golden draws its lines, not its particles.
[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3]

